# {{.Name}}

An [alis](https://github.com/ahoffner/alis) pack.

## Install

```bash
alis pack add <this repo's git URL>
```

While working on it locally, link your checkout instead so edits show up straight away:

```bash
alis pack add .
```

## Writing commands

Commands live in `alis.toml`. Each one is an `alias`, a `function` (runs in your shell) or a
`script` (an executable in `bin/`). Run `alis list --pack {{.Name}}` to see them and
`alis doctor` to check for problems.
